cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Legumin-Vicilin-Oligomer-Thermal-Shear-MD: GROMACS simulations of the pea legumin hexamer and vicilin trimer under heat and shear"
authors:
  - given-names: "Malik Ahmed Hassan"
    family-names: "Awan"
    affiliation: "Bahauddin Zakariya University, Multan, Pakistan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/malikahmedhassanawan/Legumin-Vicilin-Oligomer-Thermal-Shear-MD"
url: "https://github.com/malikahmedhassanawan/Legumin-Vicilin-Oligomer-Thermal-Shear-MD"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-29"
abstract: "GROMACS simulations of the pea legumin hexamer and the vicilin trimer at 300 K, at 373 K, and at 373 K with box shear. Each condition was run twice for 1 ns. The repository holds the setup files, trajectories' analysis outputs, comparison tables and figures, and the Colab notebooks used to produce them."
keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - GROMACS
  - legumin
  - vicilin
  - plant protein
  - thermal processing
  - shear
  - AlphaFold3
